WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
How exactly did I bully you?

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,800
I used to work as a part-time image model in the sales office for 7 days

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,000
Although I got the part-time factory fee of 14,000 yuan,

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,200
But then you bought this 45 million villa in full

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,400
According to regulations, I should get 2.5% sales commission

6
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,000
A full 1.125 million

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,800
It turns out that the Dogecoin real estate owner

8
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,400
Making all kinds of excuses to push back the truth

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,800
Just delaying and not giving.

10
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:22,270
Is that real estate owner a male or female owner?

11
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:24,670
Your focus is too strange, right?

12
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:26,070
Is there any difference between men and women?

13
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,070
Could it be that a man beating a woman to death is a co-op?

14
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,270
The boss is a man

15
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,500
But it was a female manager who approached me to sign a part-time agreement.

16
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,900
The female manager suddenly resigned a few days ago

17
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,500
Now there's a new female manager

18
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,100
Pick out words from old contracts every day

19
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,700
I mean it's the senior management of the company.

20
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,900
I don’t recognize this commission at all.

21
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,100
The real estate boss is worth billions

22
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,700
I won’t ruin my reputation just for the sake of more than 1 million.

23
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,700
Otherwise, who else would dare to sell a house?

24
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:53,300
It's probably because the new manager saw that you have no background.
